{
  "bio": [
    "Susan Ocampo is a large shareholder of semiconductor firm Macom Technology Solutions. She retired from Macom's board in 2025.",
    "She cofounded semiconductor and components supplier Sirenza Microdevices in 1984 with her late husband, John Ocampo (d. 2023).",
    "The couple also cofounded technology investment firm GaAs Labs in 2008.",
    "Prior to his death, John Ocampo led Macom as chairman and took it public on the Nasdaq in 2012."
